<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin sets 4-week T-bill auction for Wed.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin sets 4-week T-bill auction for Wed.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak finance ministry will auction an unspecified tranche of four-week treasury bills on Wednesday, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In the ministry's last auction of four-week T-bills on December 30, average yield hit 12.549 percent.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
